{"resourceIdentifier":"5342","resourceName":"Yingkou Dashiqiao LFG Power Generation Project","description":"Yingkou Dashiqiao LFG Power Generation Project  (hereinafter referred to as “the Project”) is a landfill gas (LFG) recovery and utilization project located at Dashiqiao Huzhuang Landfill, Huzhuang Town, Dashiqiao City, Yingkou City, Liaoning Province, People’s Republic of China.\r\nThe purpose of the project is to capture and utilize landfill gas for power generation. The electricity generated by the project is supplied to Northeast Power Grid (NEPG). The new gas extraction and utilization systems have been installed by the project. Before the implementation of the project activity, the landfill gas that was captured and utilized by the project was emitted into the atmosphere directly. Equivalent electricity was provided by Northeast Power Grid (NEPG) which is dominated by coal-fired power stations. This is the scenario that existed prior to the implementation of the project activity and is also the baseline scenario.\r\nThe Project achieves emission reductions in two aspects: 1) it avoids methane emissions by capturing and destroying LFG which would have been directly vented into the atmosphere in the baseline scenario; 2) it reduces CO2 emissions by displacing part of the electricity that would otherwise have been supplied by NEPG.","location":{"latitude":40.721884,"longitude":122.558453},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2025-04-03","endExclusive":"2025-05-04","endInclusive":"2025-05-03"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"5342"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Liaoning"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Dashiqiao Xinzhongshui Environmental Protection Technology Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Liaoning Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values"